orbids ID reuse, so this item is filed under a fresh monotonic ID instead of overwriting BOB-076; the real BOB-076 (jackett submodule bump) is untouched and unrelated to this incident -- it was independently already resolved via commit 99a486e. See docs/incidents/2026-08-18-perceived-forced-logout-2nd.md for full forensic detail and docs/QA_DISCOVERY_LEDGER.md entry FORCED-LOGOUT-2026-08-18-2ND for the coverage-escape audit.\u000a\u000a'),'section',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-18 20:55:07','2026-08-18 20:55:07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
